@patterns.strategy

Purpose:
  Interchangeable algorithm family.

Owns: references\patterns\strategy.sdd
UseWhen:
  - multiple variants of algorithm
  - need to switch algorithms at runtime
  - avoid conditional complexity

AvoidWhen:
  - only one algorithm
  - simple variation

Why:
  Encapsulates each algorithm and makes them interchangeable.

Related:
  @patterns.factory

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
